---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE, ELSEWHERE } from "../site";
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm Alfred Adarkwah, though most people call me Fredo. I'm an
      operations architect: I design the workflows, systems, and habits that
      help small teams do big work.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started out managing creative projects and learned quickly that
      I'm not really a project manager. I'm an operator. I care less about
      the Gantt chart and more about whether the team is set up to win.
      Fredo's House grew out of that.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days I'm Director of Growth at Ghost Note Agency, and I work
      with founders and agencies through Fredo's House. I'm based in
      {SITE.location}.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="label">Elsewhere</p>
  <ul class="rows">
    {ELSEWHERE.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a><span class="meta">↗</span></li>)}
  </ul>
</Base>
